  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Animal_Armor_Trims/BH_AAT_header.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"549\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">现在你可以使用你的纹饰来修改马和狼盔甲的外观（适用于 1.20.6 及更高版本）！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">功能很简单，与原版纹饰的功能非常相似。只需将原本用于玩家盔甲的纹饰，直接应用到任意马或狼的盔甲上即可！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要服务器和朋友一起游玩吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Animal_Armor_Trims/BH_AAT_promo.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"376\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你想找一台服务器和朋友一起玩任何模组或整合包，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong> 是你的最佳选择！他们提供性价比最高的 Minecraft 服务器，点击<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此链接</a></strong>并使用优惠码“Lupin”即可享受 25% 的折扣。<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Animal_Armor_Trims/BH_AAT_summary.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"183\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">基本上，你将能够为马盔甲添加纹饰，并且从 1.20.6 版本（狼盔甲首次加入的版本）开始，也可为狼盔甲添加纹饰。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">现在你的动物外观会漂亮得多，因为它们的盔甲将兼容所有 Minecraft 原版纹饰。</span><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">这太棒了！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjason13official\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/860325/description_e69745c8-b22d-4d0d-a55e-5c131ae1fe50.webp\" alt=\"Jason13 Ko-Fi\" width=\"286\" height=\"73\"></span></span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Animal_Armor_Trims/BH_AAT_faq.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"183\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>在服务器上能用吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">当然可以！它能完美运行！记得与朋友和模组一起游玩的最佳方式就是使用 BisectHosting，通过 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>点击此链接即可享受 25% 的折扣</strong></a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>这个模组可以用于整合包吗？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以！前提是仅发布在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上。上传至任何其他平台都将侵犯我们的权益，是绝对不允许的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不过，如果你考虑将其加入你的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 整合包中，我们将不胜感激。如果需要任何小改动或有疑问，请随时联系我们！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以录制关于此模组的视频并在我的频道展示吗？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以！你可以在你的频道自由游玩此模组或我们的任何整合包并制作相关视频，事实上，我们会对此非常感激！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Animal_Armor_Trims/BH_AAT_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/862/585/animal-armor-trims-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1027\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/872/273/animal-armor-trims-3a.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"913\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/862/604/animal-armor-trims-11.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1027\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></span></a></span></p>",
